OL,3,GNEWSATown to get #190k splash play area
OL,4,
OL,5,FA #190,000 "splash factory" will be
OL,6,Finstalled at a leisure centre in
OL,7,FLincolnshire, replacing a flume that is
OL,8,Fbeyond repair.
OL,10,FThe new attraction at Stamford Leisure
OL,11,FPool will feature tipping buckets,
OL,12,Fwater jets, water wheels and a wet play
OL,13,Farea designed for all ages and
OL,14,Fabilities.
OL,16,FSouth Kesteven District Council said
OL,17,Fthe existing flume, which has been out
OL,18,Fof action for several months, would be
OL,19,Fremoved outside of opening hours.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
