OL,3,GNEWSATown to get #190k splash play area
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe authority said the play pool would
OL,6,Fclose for a short period of time while
OL,7,Fconstruction takes place in the beach
OL,8,Farea, although dates have yet to be
OL,9,Fconfirmed.
